{
  "$description": "Relai design tokens: the single source for web and mobile. Colour names and values match the variables in the Pencil design (Relay design/relay.pen); the type, radius and size values are the ones its components and screens use. Edit this file, then run `pnpm run tokens` in relai-web, which regenerates src/styles/tokens.css, src/styles/theme.css and src/theme/tokens.ts here, and src/theme/tokens.ts in relai-mobile.",
